        "width": 198.52587926509185,
        "height": 97.92230971128608,
        "left": 74.11044619422572,
        "top": 228.45784776902886,
        "content": "Davolash usullari turli muammolar uchun ishlab chiqilgan. Har bir usulning o'ziga xos afzalliklari bor.",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "maxCharacters": 180,
        "elementIndex": 25
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 179.92125984251965,
        "height": 128.66362204724408,
        "left": 74.11044619422572,
        "top": 411.33637795275587,
        "content": "Ushbu usullar sog'liqni yaxshilashga, kasalliklarni oldini olishga yordam beradi. Har bir usul individual yondashuvni talab qiladi.",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "maxCharacters": 220,
        "elementIndex": 29
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 202.2468241469816,
        "height": 128.66362204724408,
        "left": 370.9137007874015,
        "top": 411.33637795275587,
        "content": "Yuqori samarali davolash usullari bilan zamonaviy tibbiyot o'zining imkoniyatlarini kengaytirmoqda. Yangiliklar va tadqiqotlar doimiy ravishda davom etmoqda.",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "maxCharacters": 240,
        "elementIndex": 33
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 218.3709186351706,
        "height": 90.97700787401574,
        "left": 364.7122309711286,
        "top": 215.55821522309708,
        "content": "Davolash jarayonida bemorlarning individual xususiyatlarini hisobga olish muhimdir. Har bir bemorning holati alohida baholanadi.",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "maxCharacters": 162,
        "elementIndex": 37
      },
      {
        "type": "shape",
        "width": 300,
        "height": 25,
        "left": 0,
        "top": 0,
        "content": "Davolash usullarining xilma-xilligi",
        "fontSize": 8,
        "maxCharacters": 148,
        "elementIndex": 41
      }
    ],
    "note": ""
